('The percentage error in measuring the volume of a sphere using a Vernier caliper (LC = 0.01 cm) when the diameter is measured as $5.00\;\text{cm}$ is', '$0.3\%$', '$0.2\%$', '$1.2\%$', '$0.6\%$', 'option4', '$\Delta V/V = 3\Delta d/d = 3 \times 0.01/5.00 = 0.006 = 0.6\%$.', 'p_exp_mechanics', 3, 'JEE Mains Prep', 'approved'),
